<section class="page-intro"><div class="eyebrow">A COLLECTION OF DAYS</div><h1><% if (is_tag()) { %># <%= page.tag %><% } else if (page.year) { %><%= page.year %><% if (page.month) { %><span class="archive-month"> / <%= String(page.month).padStart(2, '0') %></span><% } %><% } else { %>P (doom) = 0.8.<% } %></h1><p>写下的每一刻，都在这里。共 <%= page.posts.length %> 篇文字。</p></section>
<div class="archive-layout"><div class="archive-content"><% year_groups(page.posts.sort('-date').toArray()).forEach(function(group) { %><section class="archive-year" id="year-<%= group.year %>"><div class="archive-year-heading"><h2><%= group.year %></h2><span><%= group.entries.length %> 篇</span></div><div class="archive-list"><% group.entries.forEach(function(post) { %><a class="archive-item" href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>"><time datetime="<%= post.date.toISOString() %>"><%= date(post.date, 'MM.DD') %></time><h3><%= post.title %></h3><span class="archive-item-reading"><%= reading_stats(post).minutes %> 分钟</span><%- icon('diagonal') %></a><% }); %></div></section><% }); %></div><aside class="archive-aside"><span class="small-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>日子翻过一页，<br>文字留在原地。</p><a class="text-link" href="<%- url_for('/') %>">回到文字 <%- icon('arrow') %></a></aside></div>
